  {
   "id": "portrait-of-a-torn-318362@major-2026-03-05",
   "gameId": "portrait-of-a-torn-318362",
   "displayName": "Portrait of a Torn: The Definitive Update - Now on PS5!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-05T09:00:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're excited to share the biggest update the game has ever received, and some huge news in partnership with Firenut Games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Portrait of a Torn is now available on PS5, and coming very soon to Xbox!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We wanted to take this occasion to give the game the love it deserves on all platforms, so here's everything that's new:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fully New Voice Over - The entire game has been re-recorded with professional voice actors, bringing a whole new level of immersion to the experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "18 Supported Languages - The game is now available in 18 languages besides English: French, Italian, German, Spanish, Chinese (Simplified), Korean, Greek, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese (PT / BR), Russian, Indonesian, Romanian, Turkish, Vietnamese, and Catalan.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Cover Art - To celebrate the console launch, we've given the game a fresh new look with completely new cover artwork.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance Improvements - General performance optimizations across the board for a smoother experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Community Extras - Based on your feedback, we've added quality of life improvements like a skip button for the piano puzzle, among others.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor Bug Fixes & Improvements - Small fixes and detail tweaks to keep things polished.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A huge thank you to everyone in the community who helped localize the game into their language, and to all the players who took the time to share feedback and report issues in the forums. This update is as much yours as it is ours.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for playing!!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "J&K",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Indigo Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3059500/Portrait_of_a_Torn/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
